{
  "about": "The developer seed's invented rows (scripts/db-seed.mjs, pnpm db:seed-demo): two invented sites, fourteen nights of reports from each, five alerts of every severity and kind (one acknowledged and settled), two months of money with one estimate reconciled, the change a build cost was spent on with the prediction it shipped with, meadow.example's two counter readings and six change notes. Rows of the store's own tables, in its own column names; the store hands out every number and place. An alert names its report by site and day; a correction names the entry it replaces by that entry's external_id. Instants are UTC, as new Date().toISOString() writes them; days relative to 2026-07-05.",
